# ⚠️ NOT ENFORCED BY GITHUB PAGES — read the rules here as intent only.
# This is Netlify / Cloudflare-Pages syntax. The static site is served by
# GitHub Pages, which ignores this file completely, so none of the rules
# below have any effect. Verified 2026-09-27: /git-tracker.html and
# /unofficial/sway.html both returned 404, and /index.html + the www host
# both served duplicate 200s.
#
# The enforcing copy lives in scripts/cloudflare-edge-hardening.sh, which
# installs them as Cloudflare Single Redirects at the edge. If you change a
# rule here, change it there too, then run that script.
#
# Retired 2026-08-21: Git Tracker page replaced by the Release Changelog.
/git-tracker.html /changelog.html 301
/git-tracker-all.js /changelog.html 301
# WWW → non-WWW canonical redirect (Netlify style)
www.acreetionos.org https://acreetionos.org 301
# /index.html duplicates the homepage — force the canonical root URL
# (fixes "Alternate page with proper canonical tag" in Search Console)
# NOTE: currently served as a 200; mitigated only by the <link rel=canonical>
# in index.html, not by this rule.
/index.html / 301
# Old wiki-style path that 404s; content lives on the Unofficial page
/unofficial/sway.html /unofficial.html 301
